    "sub_name": "商業創新專題",
    "sub_ename": "INDIVIDUAL STUDIES IN BUSINESS INNOVATION",
    "describe_ch": "由教師與企業共同指定專題題目，製作專題報告。面對瞬息萬變的未來與社會環境快速變遷，同學必須學習創新與開創的方法，以及如何站在制高點思考各種問題並預見未來，並且具備有動手做的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The topic and report is jointly designated by the teacher and the company.\r\nFacing the changing future and rapid changes in the social environment, students must learn how to innovate and create, simulate the role of the commanding heights to think about various issues and anticipate the future and most importantly, the ability of implementation.\r\n",
